The '''Rockstar Advanced Game Engine''' ('''RAGE''') is a [[Proprietary software|proprietary]] [[game engine]] of [[Rockstar Games]], developed by the RAGE Technology Group [[Division (business)|division]] of [[Rockstar San Diego]] (formerly Angel Studios), based on the Angel Game Engine. Since its first game, ''[[Rockstar Games Presents Table Tennis]]'' in 2006, released for the [[Xbox 360]] and [[Wii]], the engine has been used by Rockstar Games's internal studios to develop advanced [[open world]] games for computers and consoles.

